{"schema":1,"locale":"zh-Hans","created_at":"2026-11-28T19:09:29.800Z","entries":{"docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/bsr **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/bsr \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/bsr/rp-set **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/bsr/rp-set \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/igmp-interface-template **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/igmp-interface-template \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/instance **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/instance \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/interface **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/interface \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/interface-template **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/interface-template \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/neighbor **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/neighbor \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/static-rp **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/static-rp \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/uib-g **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/uib-g \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/pimsm/uib-sg **Conditions:** !smips **Type:** Directory":"## routing/pimsm/uib-sg \n**条件：** !smips\n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/rip/instance **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/instance \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/rip/interface **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/interface \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/rip/interface-template **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/interface-template \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/rip/keys **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/keys \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000## routing/rip/neighbor **Type:** Directory":"## routing/rip/neighbor \n**类型：** 目录","docs-7.25\u0000MD5 authentication key chains.":"MD5 认证密钥链。","docs-7.25\u0000The instance menu defines the main PIM-SM settings. The instance is then used for all other PIM-related configurations like interface-template, static RP, and Bootstrap Router.":"instance 菜单用于定义 PIM-SM 的主要设置。该实例随后用于所有其他 PIM 相关配置，例如 interface-template、static RP 和 Bootstrap Router。","docs-7.25\u0000The interface menu shows all interfaces that are currently participating in PIM and their statuses. This menu contains dynamic and read-only entries that get created by defined interface templates.":"interface 菜单显示当前参与 PIM 的所有接口及其状态。该菜单包含由已定义接口模板创建的动态只读条目。","docs-7.25\u0000The interface template menu defines which interfaces will participate in PIM and what per-interface configuration will be used.":"接口模板菜单定义哪些接口将参与 PIM，以及将使用哪些每接口配置。","docs-7.25\u0000The maximum metric of a RIP route is 15. A metric higher than 15 is considered 'infinity' and routes with such a metric are considered unreachable. Thus RIP cannot be used on networks with more than 15 hops between any two routers, and using redistribute metrics larger than 1 further reduces this maximum hop count.":"RIP 路由的最大 metric 为 15。大于 15 的 metric 被视为“infinity”，具有该 metric 的路由被视为不可达。因此，RIP 不能用于任意两台路由器之间超过 15 跳的网络，使用大于 1 的 redistribute metric 会进一步减少该最大跳数。","docs-7.25\u0000The neighbor menu shows all detected neighbors that are running PIM and their statuses. This menu contains dynamic and read-only entries.":"neighbor 菜单显示所有检测到的、运行 PIM 的邻居及其状态。该菜单包含动态且只读的条目。","docs-7.25\u0000The static-rp menu allows manually defining the multicast group to RP mappings. Such a mechanism is not robust to failures but does at least provide a basic interoperability mechanism.":"static-rp 菜单用于手动定义组播组到 RP 的映射。该机制对故障不具备鲁棒性，但至少提供了一种基本的互操作机制。","docs-7.25\u0000The upstream information base menus show the any-source multicast(\\*,G) and source-specific multicast(S,G) groups and their statuses. These menus contain only read-only entries.":"上游信息库菜单显示任意源组播（\\*,G）和指定源组播（S,G）组及其状态。这些菜单仅包含只读条目。","docs-7.25\u0000This submenu is used to define neighboring routers to exchange routing information with. Normally there is no need to add the neighbors, if multicasting is working properly within the network. If there are problems with exchanging routing information, neighbor routers can be added to the list. It will force the router to exchange the routing information with the neighbor using regular unicast packets.":"此子菜单用于定义要与其交换路由信息的相邻路由器。通常，如果网络内组播正常工作，则无需添加邻居。如果交换路由信息出现问题，可以将相邻路由器添加到列表中。这将强制路由器使用普通单播数据包与邻居交换路由信息。"}}
